sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant CC as ChatController
    participant OE as OfflineEngine
    participant GS as GeminiService
    participant API as Gemini / Worker
    participant R as Repo

    U->>CC: send("short sci-fi under $15")
    CC->>OE: candidates(text, 12)
    OE-->>CC: top 12 real books
    CC->>R: latestOrder (id, status, tracking only)
    CC->>GS: ask(history, text, candidates, storeFacts)
    alt key set and network OK
        GS->>API: POST generateContent (JSON mode)
        API-->>GS: JSON reply
        GS->>GS: validate ids vs candidates (drop hallucinations)
        GS-->>CC: AiReply
        CC->>R: booksByIds(valid ids)
        CC-->>U: reply + reading-list cards (ONLINE)
    else no key / timeout / 429 / bad JSON
        GS-->>CC: null
        CC->>OE: respond(text)
        OE-->>CC: OfflineReply(text, books, why)
        CC-->>U: reply + cards (OFFLINE MODE)
    end
    Note over U,CC: Add / Save only happen after an explicit confirmation tap
